TERM_ID^단말ID^64^0^0^0^0^0^0
TERM_OS_CODE^단말운영체제코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
REG_YN_IQRY_KEY^등록여부조회키^64^0^0^0^0^0^0
REG_FORM_CODE^등록방식코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
NID_CMPA_NO^비식별호환번호^21^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
TERM_MODL_NO^단말모델번호^50^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="122" _ulen="98" >

CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
ATHN_TCHN_CODE^인증기술코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
TERM_ID^단말ID^64^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obtss_fido_011a" title="공동FIDO2.0등록요청 전송(02003" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="221" _ulen="169" >

ELFN_ID^전자금융ID^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
TERM_ID^단말ID^64^0^0^0^0^0^0
SVCD^서비스코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
ATHN_TCHN_CODE^인증기술코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
NTAT_ISNC_CLCD^인증서발급구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="270" _ulen="202" >

RSPN_CODE^응답코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
RSPN_MSG_CNTT^응답메시지내용^100^0^0^0^0^0^0
OTSD_TR_UNIQ_NO^대외거래고유번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
BIO_TLMS_TRC_NO^바이오전문추적번호^21^0^0^0^0^0^0
FIDO_TLMS_TRC_NO^FIDO전문추적번호^21^0^0^0^0^0^0

